1. Covered assets ("the Assets")
--------------------------------

* the pixel art: sprites, animation strips, tiles and frames in `web/public/pixel/`;
* the UI glyphs in `web/public/icons/`;
* the sprite and glyph data generated from them in `web/src/hibiscus/*.gen.ts`;
* the mascot "Hibi" (a robot arm holding a hibiscus flower) in every pose, size and mood;
* the hibiscus logo / mark, the "Hibiscus" lockups and the favicons (`web/public/favicon.*`,
  `web/public/apple-touch-icon.png`);
* the same files where a build copies them (`web/dist/`, `hibiscus_station/static/` inside the
  wheel and the container images);
* the screenshots in `docs/images/` insofar as they show the Assets.

The Assets are produced from the private Hibiscus design system (github.com/Bigkatoan/hibiscus-assets);
only the built files above are distributed with Hibiscus Station. The design sources are not part of
this repository and are not licensed to you.

